6. Finally, if you're willing to invest in a higher-end option, the BabylissPRO FXONE trimmer should definitely be on your radar. Running up to 3 hours on an interchangeable lithium battery and featuring a brushless motor, metal housing, and 7200 RPM deep-tooth T-blade, this trimmer is built for barbers who demand nothing but the best.</s>

